A game backend

The group `Game` holds `Matchmaker` and `Game server`. `Player` asks the
`Matchmaker`, and the `Matchmaker` assigns a `Game server`. The `Game server`
writes results to `Stats`, as `server/results.go` line 30 shows. The `Player`
must never call `Stats` directly. Show it as a flow.
---
Game { Matchmaker, Game server }
Player -> Matchmaker: ask
Matchmaker -> Game server: assign
Game server -> Stats: results @ server/results.go:30
Player -x Stats
show flow
